{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12946","headline":"夏中詶于逖毕燿问病见赠 · 独孤及","name":"夏中詶于逖毕燿问病见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"救物智所昧，学仙愿未从。\n行藏两乖角，蹭蹬风波中。\n薄宦耻降志，卧痾非养蒙。\n闭关涉两旬，羇思浩无穷。\n鸑鷟何处来，双舞下碧空。\n离别隔云雨，惠然此相逢。\n把手贺疾间，举杯欣酒浓。\n新诗见久要，清论激深衷。\n高馆舒夜簟，开门延微风。\n火云赫嵯峨，日暮千万峯。\n遥指故山笑，相看抚号钟。\n声和由心清，事感知气同。\n出处未易料，且歌缓愁容。\n愿君崇明德，岁暮如青松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}